  "prefLabel": "Gen 402.03 Documents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 402.03 Documents. Applicants for renewal of their licenses shall include in their application packets the “Addendum to the Universal Application for License Renewal for Genetic Counselors”, revised April 2025, with a photocopy of the current certificate issued by one of the following:\n\n(a) The American Board of Genetic Counseling (ABGC), or its successor organization; or\n\n(b) American Board of Medical Genetics (ABMG), or its successor organization.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 402.06) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35 (formerly Gen 402.06)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen400.html"
